    detail
        - `Working`, `InputRequired`, `Completed`, `Failed` and `Cancelled`, encoded as `working`,
        - `input_required`, `completed`, `failed` and `cancelled`.
        + `Working`, `InputRequired`, `Completed`, `Failed` et `Cancelled`, encodés en `working`,
        + `input_required`, `completed`, `failed` et `cancelled`.
    entry .encodable
